--- A field first given an empty list takes a list written down for it as
--- a list (it had been written the literal's tensor: "expected a list"
--- interpreted, no build compiled), and a field every constructor gave 0
--- is a record or none once a record of its kind is written into it (it
--- had been typed an int). Rosetta Code, Blossom algorithm, Deepcopy.
struct S [queue]

s = S[[]]
s.queue = [3]
log[len[s.queue]]

struct Node [name, next]

n = Node['a', 0]
m = Node['b', 0]
n.next = m
log[n]
